  "content": "<p>Hudbay Minerals Inc. is a diversified mining company primarily focused on the discovery, production, and marketing of base and precious metals. Headquartered in Toronto, Canada, the company operates long-life assets in North and South America, including mines in Manitoba, British Columbia, and Peru, as well as development projects in Arizona and Nevada. Hudbay is a leading producer of copper, gold, and zinc, committed to sustainable mining practices and creating long-term value for its stakeholders through efficient operations and strategic exploration.</p>\n",
  "tabs": [
    {
      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Peter%20Kukielski\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Peter Kukielski</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">July 2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President and Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Kukielski was appointed President and Chief Executive Officer of Hudbay in 2019. He has more than 30 years of experience in the mining industry. Previously, he was Executive Chairman of Waratah Resources Limited and President and CEO of Nevsun Resources Ltd. He also served as Chief Executive of ArcelorMittal Mining and held executive positions at Teck Resources and Falconbridge.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Eugene%20Lei\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Eugene Lei</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">September 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Lei was appointed Chief Financial Officer in 2022. He joined Hudbay in 2012 and has held progressively senior roles in corporate development and strategy. Prior to Hudbay, he was an investment banker at a major Canadian bank.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Andre%20Lauzon\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Andre Lauzon</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Operating Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Lauzon was appointed Chief Operating Officer in 2022. He joined Hudbay in 2012 and has held various operational leadership roles, including Vice President of the Manitoba Business Unit and Vice President, Business Development and Technical Services.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Patrick%20Donnelly\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Patrick Donnelly</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Senior Vice President, Legal and Organizational Effectiveness</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Donnelly was appointed Senior Vice President, Legal and Organizational Effectiveness in 2022. He joined Hudbay in 2008 and has served as General Counsel since 2011.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Carol%20Banducci\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Carol Banducci</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Banducci was formerly the EVP and CFO of IAMGOLD Corporation. She has extensive experience in financial management and corporate strategy in the mining and manufacturing sectors.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Cashel%20Meagher\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Cashel Meagher</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">November 2008</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Senior Vice President and Chief Operating Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Meagher has over 25 years of experience in the mining industry. He previously served as Senior Vice President and Chief Operating Officer of Hudbay Minerals Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/David%20Smith\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">David Smith</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Smith is a geologist with over 30 years of experience in the mining industry, specializing in exploration and development.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/George%20Paspalas\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">George Paspalas</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Paspalas is the President and CEO of MAG Silver Corp. He has over 30 years of experience in the mining industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Jacqueline%20Allison\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Jacqueline Allison</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">Not specified</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director, Investor Relations</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Dr. Allison has over 20 years of experience in the mining industry as a research analyst and investment manager.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Jeane%20Hull\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Jeane Hull</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Hull was formerly the EVP and Chief Technical Officer of Peabody Energy. She has extensive experience in engineering and operations.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Stephen%20Lang\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Stephen Lang</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chair of the Board</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Lang is the Chair of the Board. He was formerly the President and CEO of Centerra Gold Inc. and has over 40 years of experience in the mining industry, including executive roles at Stillwater Mining Company and Barrick Gold.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Peter%20Kukielski\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Peter Kukielski</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">July 2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">President and Chief Executive Officer of Hudbay Minerals Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Carol%20Banducci\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Carol Banducci</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Banducci was formerly the EVP and CFO of IAMGOLD Corporation. She has extensive experience in financial management and corporate strategy in the mining and manufacturing sectors.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Igor%20Gonzales\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Igor Gonzales</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2013</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Gonzales was formerly the COO of Buenaventura and Barrick Gold. He has over 35 years of experience in the mining industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Jeane%20Hull\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Jeane Hull</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Hull was formerly the EVP and Chief Technical Officer of Peabody Energy. She has extensive experience in engineering and operations.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/George%20Paspalas\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">George Paspalas</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Paspalas is the President and CEO of MAG Silver Corp. He has over 30 years of experience in the mining industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/David%20Smith\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">David Smith</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Smith was formerly the CFO of Finning International Inc. and Ballard Power Systems.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Jacqueline%20Allison\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Jacqueline Allison</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">Not specified</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director, Investor Relations</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Dr. Allison has over 20 years of experience in the mining industry as a research analyst and investment manager.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1312069/000110465924040244/tm2410183d1_6k.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">SEC Form 6-K - Management Information Circular</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-03-27)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.hudbayminerals.com/about-us/leadership-and-governance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Hudbay Minerals Official Website - Leadership and Governance</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-20)</span></li></ul>"
    }
  ]
